+/*
+ * ProjectRevisions.h - the bounded previous-revision set of a project file
+ *                     (SPEC A16 deliverable 4: FILE-LEVEL REVERSIBILITY).
+ *
+ * Copyright (c) 2026 Zene Studio contributors
