@@ -0,0 +1,183 @@
+/*
+ * ControlDeviceCatalogue.cpp - the build's device catalogue behind
+ *                              plugin.list and the dev-<n> ids (SPEC A11-A14).
+ *
+ * Copyright (c) 2026 Zene Studio contributors
+ *
+ * This file is part of LMMS - https://lmms.io
+ *
