@@ -0,0 +1,398 @@
+/*
+ * ControlServer.cpp - the opt-in, local-only JSON-RPC control socket (SPEC A12).
+ *
+ * Copyright (c) 2026 Zene Studio contributors
+ *
+ * This file is part of LMMS - https://lmms.io
+ *
